{"ref":"BDB, פְּאֵר","hw":"פְּאֵר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאֵר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.18\">Ez 44:18</a></sup> <strong>head-dress, turban (</strong>? orig. <em>ornament</em><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> of bridegroom <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.10\">Is 61:10</a>, sign of joy v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.3\">3</a> (opp. mourning, and so) <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאֵרְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:17\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.17\">Ez 24:17</a>, pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאֵרֵכֶם</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:23\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.23\">23</a> (worn by men of position); of priests <span dir=\"rtl\">פַּאֲרֵי פִשְׁתִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 44:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.44.18\">Ez 44:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">פּ׳ הַמִּגְבָּעֹת שֵׁשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:28\" href=\"/Exodus.39.28\">Ex 39:28</a> (P); pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּאֵרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.20\">Is 3:20</a> (of luxurious women).","next":"BDB, תִּפְאָרָה","prev":"BDB, פָּאַר"}